      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of Board. There is established, effective July 10,1988, \na board of three m em bers to be appointed by the President to investigate this \ndispute. No m em ber shall be pecuniarily or otherw ise interested in any \norganization of railroad em ployees or any carrier. The Board shall perform its \nfunctions su bject to the availability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2098,
